{"seq":3,"slug":"query-optimizer-plan-cost-model","title":"查询优化器、物理计划与代价模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/embedded-columnar-analytics-duckdb-arrow/columnar-execution-vectorized-engine/query-optimizer-plan-cost-model","wordCount":2472,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"查询优化器-物理计划与代价模型\">查询优化器、物理计划与代价模型</h1><p>一条 <code>SELECT</code> 在 DuckDB 里从被解析到出结果，中间要过一道并不显眼的关口：优化器把「逻辑上正确的算子树」改写成「物理上便宜的算子树」。判据是代价模型——它用每个算子的估计基数和单位行成本，给候选计划打分，选分最低的那个执行。列式引擎之所以能把代价模型做对，是因为它的扫描算子一次出批 1024~2048 行、每个算子都能报出准确的输出行数，于是估计值与实测值之间的偏差可被 <code>EXPLAIN ANALYZE</code> 逐算子量化并回头修正。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>优化器在 DuckDB 中分三阶段推进：<strong>逻辑计划（logical plan）→ 优化后逻辑计划（optimized logical plan）→ 物理计划（physical plan）</strong>。逻辑计划表达「查什么」，算子还是抽象的投影、过滤、连接、聚合；物理计划决定「怎么查」，把每个抽象算子绑定到具体实现——顺序扫描 <code>SEQ_SCAN</code>、哈希连接 <code>HASH_JOIN</code>、投影 <code>PROJECTION</code>、过滤 <code>FILTER</code>，并给出各自的实际执行策略。<code>PRAGMA explain_output</code> 控制打印哪一层：默认 <code>physical_only</code> 只出物理计划，<code>optimized_only</code> 只出优化后的逻辑计划，<code>all</code> 两层都出（见 <a href=\"https://duckdb.org/docs/current/guides/meta/explain.html\">https://duckdb.org/docs/current/guides/meta/explain.html</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    SQL[SQL 文本] --&gt; PARSE[解析&lt;br/&gt;抽象语法树]&#10;    PARSE --&gt; LOGICAL[逻辑计划&lt;br/&gt;抽象算子树]&#10;    LOGICAL --&gt; OPT[逻辑优化&lt;br/&gt;下推 / 重写 / 常量折叠]&#10;    OPT --&gt; OL[优化后逻辑计划]&#10;    OL --&gt; BIND[算子绑定&lt;br/&gt;选择物理实现]&#10;    BIND --&gt; PHYS[物理计划&lt;br/&gt;SEQ_SCAN / HASH_JOIN / AGGREGATE]&#10;    PHYS --&gt; COST[代价模型打分&lt;br/&gt;cost = Σ c_o × |o|]&#10;    COST --&gt; EXEC[向量化执行&lt;br/&gt;按批 1024~2048 行出批]&#10;    EXEC --&gt; ANALYZE[EXPLAIN ANALYZE&lt;br/&gt;EC vs 实际基数]&#10;    ANALYZE -.回灌统计.-&gt; COST\">graph TD\n    SQL[SQL 文本] --&gt; PARSE[解析&lt;br/&gt;抽象语法树]\n    PARSE --&gt; LOGICAL[逻辑计划&lt;br/&gt;抽象算子树]\n    LOGICAL --&gt; OPT[逻辑优化&lt;br/&gt;下推 / 重写 / 常量折叠]\n    OPT --&gt; OL[优化后逻辑计划]\n    OL --&gt; BIND[算子绑定&lt;br/&gt;选择物理实现]\n    BIND --&gt; PHYS[物理计划&lt;br/&gt;SEQ_SCAN / HASH_JOIN / AGGREGATE]\n    PHYS --&gt; COST[代价模型打分&lt;br/&gt;cost = Σ c_o × |o|]\n    COST --&gt; EXEC[向量化执行&lt;br/&gt;按批 1024~2048 行出批]\n    EXEC --&gt; ANALYZE[EXPLAIN ANALYZE&lt;br/&gt;EC vs 实际基数]\n    ANALYZE -.回灌统计.-&gt; COST</pre><p>三层的分工可以直接对照下表理解。读者最容易混淆的是「优化后逻辑计划」与「物理计划」都叫「优化后的计划」——前者仍未绑定实现，后者已经锁定具体算子。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>计划层</th>\n<th>打印开关</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>是否执行查询</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>逻辑计划</td>\n<td><code>optimized_only</code> 对比 <code>all</code></td>\n<td>抽象算子、未下推的过滤</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优化后逻辑计划</td>\n<td><code>optimized_only</code> / <code>all</code></td>\n<td>已下推过滤、已重写表达式</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物理计划</td>\n<td><code>physical_only</code>（默认）</td>\n<td>绑定后的 <code>SEQ_SCAN</code>/<code>HASH_JOIN</code> 等</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>带计时的物理计划</td>\n<td><code>EXPLAIN ANALYZE</code></td>\n<td>逐算子历时 + <code>EC</code> 与实测基数</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键区别在于：<code>EXPLAIN</code> 只打印、<strong>不执行</strong>查询，每个算子只带一个由表统计和启发式规则推出的 <code>EC</code>（estimated cardinality，估计基数）；<code>EXPLAIN ANALYZE</code> 则会真正跑一遍查询，把每个算子的运行数字、估计基数 <code>EC</code> 与实际基数并排打印出来（见 <a href=\"https://duckdb.org/docs/current/guides/meta/explain_analyze.html\">https://duckdb.org/docs/current/guides/meta/explain_analyze.html</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"逻辑优化-下推-重写与常量折叠\">逻辑优化：下推、重写与常量折叠</h2><p>优化器在第一阶段做的是「不改语义地减少要处理的行」。最典型的一类是<strong>谓词下推（filter pushdown）</strong>：把过滤尽量压到扫描层，让列段解码之前就把不匹配的行组跳过。DuckDB 官方示例里，<code>WHERE name LIKE &#39;Ma%&#39;</code> 会被重写成前缀区间条件，最终落在 <code>SEQ_SCAN</code> 上打印为 <code>filters: name &gt;= Ma AND name &lt; Mb AND name IS NOT NULL</code>——<code>LIKE</code> 被拆成左闭右开的字符串区间加一个空值判否，三者都能在扫描时按批求值（见 <a href=\"https://duckdb.org/docs/current/guides/meta/explain.html\">https://duckdb.org/docs/current/guides/meta/explain.html</a>）。</p>\n<p>第二类是<strong>投影下推（projection pushdown）</strong>，在列式引擎里收益最大：扫描只读查询引用到的列段，未引用的列段根本不进内存。这与列式存储的物理布局直接耦合——行组内的列段可独立解码，跳列等于跳过整段 I/O。第三类是<strong>常量折叠与表达式简化</strong>：可离线算出的子表达式在计划期就算完，不再占用执行期的每行求值预算。</p>\n<p>这些改写之所以能安全进行，前提是列式引擎保留了足够多的<strong>每列统计</strong>：最小值、最大值、是否有空值、以及段级 zonemap。它们既是下推的判据，也是下一节基数估计的输入。<code>PRAGMA storage_info(&#39;表名&#39;)</code> 能逐段列出段类型与选中编码，是确认统计与编码现状的第一手工具（见 <a href=\"https://duckdb.org/2022/10/28/lightweight-compression.html\">https://duckdb.org/2022/10/28/lightweight-compression.html</a>）。关于编码选择本身如何影响扫描成本，同 hub 的 <a href=\"columnar-storage-encoding-compression\">列式存储布局、编码与压缩策略</a> 有完整展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代价模型与基数估计\">代价模型与基数估计</h2><p>代价模型给候选物理计划打分，形式上可以写成各算子加权和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>cost</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>o</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{cost}(P) = \\sum_{o \\in P} c_o \\cdot |o|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3717em;vertical-align:-1.3217em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是算子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span></span></span></span></span> 处理单行的成本系数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|o|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 是该算子的<strong>估计输出基数</strong>。连接算子的输出规模由选择性决定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>⋈</mo><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≈</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>ndv</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mtext>ndv</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|R \\bowtie S| \\approx s \\cdot |R| \\cdot |S|, \\qquad s = \\frac{1}{\\max(\\text{ndv}(R.a),\\, \\text{ndv}(S.a))}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⋈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2574em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ndv</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ndv</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ndv</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ndv}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ndv</span></span></span></span></span></span> 是连接键上的不同值个数（number of distinct values），来自每列统计。这个式子揭示了代价模型最脆弱的地方：<strong>估计基数的质量决定计划的质量</strong>。若两表在连接键上的 ndv 都被低估，优化器会误判某个连接是小结果集，进而选错连接顺序，把一个本可流式的计划变成需要落盘的哈希连接。</p>\n<p>DuckDB 的连接顺序优化基于动态规划：枚举子集、计算每种连接顺序的代价、保留最优。代价比较依赖的正是上面的基数估计。当估计严重偏离实际时，<code>EXPLAIN ANALYZE</code> 会把偏差直接摊开——左侧是 <code>EC</code>，右侧是实测行数。官方示例里 <code>HASH_JOIN INNER sid = sid</code> 打印为 <code>EC 1 -&gt; actual 2</code>，估计 1 行实际 2 行；<code>SEQ_SCAN students</code> 打印 <code>EC 1 -&gt; actual 2</code>。小表上的 2 倍偏差无害，但在百万行级连接上，同样的倍率会把计划推向错误的连接顺序（见 <a href=\"https://duckdb.org/docs/current/guides/meta/explain_analyze.html\">https://duckdb.org/docs/current/guides/meta/explain_analyze.html</a>）。</p>\n<p>另一个只属于列式引擎的代价项是<strong>分区裁剪（zonemap pruning）</strong>。行组（默认约 120,000 行）的每列都维护 min/max zonemap，扫描时若谓词区间与某行组的 <code>[min, max]</code> 无交集，整个行组被跳过，解码成本直接归零。裁剪的有效性取决于数据是否按该列有序——这正是 <code>ORDER BY</code> 或分区写入能大幅加速后续查询的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"物理算子选择-哈希连接与扫描路径\">物理算子选择：哈希连接与扫描路径</h2><p>物理计划阶段把抽象连接绑定为具体实现。DuckDB 的连接算子是 <code>HASH_JOIN</code>，其约定是 <strong>probe 侧在左、build 侧在右</strong>：右子树先物化成哈希表，左子树逐行探测（见 <a href=\"https://duckdb.org/docs/current/dev/profiling.html\">https://duckdb.org/docs/current/dev/profiling.html</a>）。这个方向选择由代价模型给出——build 侧应当是小表，否则哈希表大小失控。计划里 <code>HASH_JOIN</code> 的打印顺序就是执行顺序的直接证据。</p>\n<p>扫描路径的选择同理：<code>SEQ_SCAN</code> 是默认路径，走 zonemap 裁剪加向量化解码；当存在可用索引且谓词选择性足够高时，优化器才改走索引扫描。仓库侧的取舍在于：顺序扫描对宽区间谓词更优（一次解码一个行组，摊薄固定开销），索引扫描对点查更优（跳过绝大多数行组）。列式引擎通常把前者做成默认，因为分析型负载的谓词往往命中大量行，索引的随机访问反而拖慢吞吐。</p>\n<p>向量化执行的粒度是这一层的关键常量：算子按批出批，批大小为 1024~2048 行。批的存在让「每行一次函数调用」的虚函数开销被摊到上千行上，也让代价模型的单行成本系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 相对稳定。DuckDB 在排序实现上的实测可作旁证：单线程排 1 亿个随机整数约 5 秒，4 线程（M1 MacBook）约 3 秒，同规模下与专用分析引擎处于同一量级（见 <a href=\"https://duckdb.org/2021/08/27/external-sorting\">https://duckdb.org/2021/08/27/external-sorting</a>）。向量化与轻量级排序是这些数字背后的工程前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用-explain-analyze-与-profiling-读计划\">用 EXPLAIN ANALYZE 与 profiling 读计划</h2><p>读懂计划需要三个层级的工具。第一层是 <code>EXPLAIN</code>，看候选物理计划的形状与估计基数，适合在调优前确认下推是否发生。第二层是 <code>EXPLAIN ANALYZE</code>，跑一遍并对照 <code>EC</code> 与实测基数，定位「哪一步估错了」。它打印的算子是<strong>累计 wall-clock 时间</strong>，多线程下总查询时间可能小于各算子时间之和——因为并行线程在重叠区间里各算各的（见 <a href=\"https://duckdb.org/docs/current/guides/meta/explain_analyze.html\">https://duckdb.org/docs/current/guides/meta/explain_analyze.html</a>）。</p>\n<p>第三层是 profiling 开关，输出可机读、可视化的执行证据。<code>PRAGMA enable_profiling</code> 默认 <code>query_tree</code>，可选 <code>json</code>、<code>query_tree_optimizer</code>（额外附上优化器输出，用于确认某条规则是否触发）、<code>no_output</code>。<code>profiling_mode</code> 取 <code>standard</code>（默认）、<code>detailed</code> 或 <code>all</code>，后两者追加优化器与规划器指标；<code>profiling_coverage</code> 可取 <code>SELECT</code> 或 <code>ALL</code>。自 DuckDB v1.5.0 起，同样的配置可通过表函数完成：<code>CALL enable_profiling(format := ..., save_location := ..., coverage := ..., mode := ..., metrics := [...])</code>，对应 <code>CALL disable_profiling()</code>。可单独开关的指标包括 <code>LATENCY</code>、<code>OPERATOR_TIMING</code>、<code>RESULT_SET_SIZE</code> 等（见 <a href=\"https://duckdb.org/docs/current/dev/profiling.html\">https://duckdb.org/docs/current/dev/profiling.html</a>）。</p>\n<p>输出格式上，<code>EXPLAIN (FORMAT html)</code>、<code>mermaid</code>、<code>json</code>、<code>graphviz</code> 都已内置；把 <code>json</code> 写到文件后可用 <code>python -m duckdb.query_graph /path/to/file.json</code> 渲染成可交互的 HTML 查询图，直接看到每个算子的耗时占比与数据流向。排查「计划为什么慢」的常规顺序是：先用 <code>EXPLAIN</code> 确认下推与连接顺序，再用 <code>EXPLAIN ANALYZE</code> 找出估计偏差最大的算子，最后用 profile viewer 定位真正的耗时热点——三者看到的是同一条查询的不同侧面。关于查询如何落到 Arrow 表与数据湖文件上，可参考同 hub 第 3 章对 Arrow 互操作的展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>优化器分阶段推进：<strong>逻辑计划 → 优化后逻辑计划 → 物理计划</strong>，<code>PRAGMA explain_output</code> 选择打印层级，<code>EXPLAIN</code> 不执行查询。</li>\n<li>逻辑优化做三件事：谓词下推（<code>LIKE &#39;Ma%&#39;</code> → 前缀区间加空值判否）、投影下推（只读引用列段）、常量折叠。</li>\n<li>代价模型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>cost</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>o</mi></msub><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{cost}(P) = \\sum_o c_o \\cdot |o|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0017em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 的质量受制于基数估计；连接输出由选择性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>ndv</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s = 1/\\max(\\text{ndv})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ndv</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 决定，ndv 直接来自每列统计。</li>\n<li>列式引擎独有的代价项是 <strong>zonemap 裁剪</strong>：行组约 120,000 行，谓词区间与 <code>[min, max]</code> 无交集即整组跳过；排序/分区写入能显著提高裁剪命中率。</li>\n<li>物理算子约定：<code>HASH_JOIN</code> 左 probe 右 build，build 侧应为小表；批大小 1024~2048 行是向量化吞吐稳定的前提。</li>\n<li>三层诊断工具：<code>EXPLAIN</code>（估算）→ <code>EXPLAIN ANALYZE</code>（<code>EC</code> 对实测基数）→ profiling（<code>query_tree_optimizer</code> / <code>json</code> 可视化），<code>EXPLAIN ANALYZE</code> 的时间是累计 wall-clock，多线程下总时间可小于各算子之和。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Q[慢查询] --&gt; E1[EXPLAIN&lt;br/&gt;确认下推与连接顺序]&#10;    E1 --&gt; E2[EXPLAIN ANALYZE&lt;br/&gt;找 EC 偏差最大的算子]&#10;    E2 --&gt; E3[profiling json&lt;br/&gt;query_graph 渲染]&#10;    E3 --&gt; HOT[定位耗时热点算子]&#10;    E3 --&gt; STAT[回灌统计 / 调整存储顺序]&#10;    STAT --&gt; FIX[重建统计或重排 zonemap]\">graph TD\n    Q[慢查询] --&gt; E1[EXPLAIN&lt;br/&gt;确认下推与连接顺序]\n    E1 --&gt; E2[EXPLAIN ANALYZE&lt;br/&gt;找 EC 偏差最大的算子]\n    E2 --&gt; E3[profiling json&lt;br/&gt;query_graph 渲染]\n    E3 --&gt; HOT[定位耗时热点算子]\n    E3 --&gt; STAT[回灌统计 / 调整存储顺序]\n    STAT --&gt; FIX[重建统计或重排 zonemap]</pre>","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"查询优化器、物理计划与代价模型","id":"查询优化器-物理计划与代价模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"逻辑优化：下推、重写与常量折叠","id":"逻辑优化-下推-重写与常量折叠"},{"level":2,"text":"代价模型与基数估计","id":"代价模型与基数估计"},{"level":2,"text":"物理算子选择：哈希连接与扫描路径","id":"物理算子选择-哈希连接与扫描路径"},{"level":2,"text":"用 EXPLAIN ANALYZE 与 profiling 读计划","id":"用-explain-analyze-与-profiling-读计划"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"向量化执行流水线与算子实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/embedded-columnar-analytics-duckdb-arrow/columnar-execution-vectorized-engine/vectorized-execution-pipeline-operators"},"next":{"title":"Arrow 内存格式与零拷贝互操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/embedded-columnar-analytics-duckdb-arrow/arrow-interop-data-lake-query/arrow-memory-format-zero-copy"}}